169	| 10 | `PageLoadRetried` from a `pageLoadFailure` | re-attempts the same `nextCursor`, not a reload |
170	| 11 | `RecordsLocalCacheRefreshed` after a local `create()` | the newly cached entry appears, deduped if also later re-fetched |
